{"id":"d4ceb31311d0b697","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-proof-theory-notation.md","title":"Proof Theory Notation Registry","display":"df-proof-theory-notation — Proof Theory Notation Registry","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-proof-theory-notation","aliases":["72-df-proof-theory-notation"],"display":"df-proof-theory-notation — Proof Theory Notation Registry","depends_on":[],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Local notation index, not a source theorem","verification_status":"reviewed-definition","proof_status":"definition-well-defined","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-proof-theory-notation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-proof-theory-notation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-proof-theory-notation — Proof Theory Notation Registry"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Local notation index, not a source theorem"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed-definition"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"definition-well-defined"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>下式域和值域均为有限字符串集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PTNot}_{72}\">\\(\\mathrm{PTNot}_{72}\\)</span> 是文件名索引，不是数学谓词定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PTNot}_{72}:=\\{\\langle\\mathtt{EpsTerm},\\mathtt{72\\!\\!\\text{-}df\\text{-}epsilon\\text{-}operator}\\rangle,\\langle\\mathtt{Monotone},\\mathtt{72\\!\\!\\text{-}df\\text{-}inductive\\text{-}definition}\\rangle,\\langle\\mathtt{Predicative},\\mathtt{72\\!\\!\\text{-}df\\text{-}predicative\\text{-}theory}\\rangle,\\langle\\mathtt{OrdinalVal},\\mathtt{72\\!\\!\\text{-}df\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}notation}\\rangle\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PTNot}_{72}:=\\{\\langle\\mathtt{EpsTerm},\\mathtt{72\\!\\!\\text{-}df\\text{-}epsilon\\text{-}operator}\\rangle,\\langle\\mathtt{Monotone},\\mathtt{72\\!\\!\\text{-}df\\text{-}inductive\\text{-}definition}\\rangle,\\langle\\mathtt{Predicative},\\mathtt{72\\!\\!\\text{-}df\\text{-}predicative\\text{-}theory}\\rangle,\\langle\\mathtt{OrdinalVal},\\mathtt{72\\!\\!\\text{-}df\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}notation}\\rangle\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>已把任意名称集合包含任意对象的伪注册表改成实际有限字符串映射。PolyBounded由具体证明系统的多项式界定义承担，不注册一个未提供签名的通用谓词。下游仍须直接引用真实定义节点，不能凭本索引获得符号含义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{PTNot}_{72}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PTNot}_{72}:=\\{\\langle\\mathtt{EpsTerm},\\mathtt{72\\!\\!\\text{-}df\\text{-}epsilon\\text{-}operator}\\rangle,\\langle\\mathtt{Monotone},\\mathtt{72\\!\\!\\text{-}df\\text{-}inductive\\text{-}definition}\\rangle,\\langle\\mathtt{Predicative},\\mathtt{72\\!\\!\\text{-}df\\text{-}predicative\\text{-}theory}\\rangle,\\langle\\mathtt{OrdinalVal},\\mathtt{72\\!\\!\\text{-}df\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}notation}\\rangle\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1422,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-133","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-proof-theory-notation|df-proof-theory-notation — Proof Theory Notation Registry]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-131","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"ex